de=\'SCALP\' and risk_multiplier=1.0. Do not use NEUTRAL or PASS.\n\n### USER:\nMode: paper, halted: False, llm_paused: False, llm_risk_multiplier: 1.0. STATE ANALYSIS: total_equity=87698.1461, realized_pnl_today=0.0, daily_loss=0.0, drawdown=0.0. Limits: max_daily_loss_abs=200.0, max_daily_loss_pct=0.05, max_drawdown_abs=500.0, max_drawdown_pct=0.1, max_notional_per_symbol=10000.0, max_leverage=5.0. Orders: allowed=0, denied=0, deny_codes=none. Ctx: OFI=0.00, WallDist=0.0, Sig=HOLD | ATR=0.0, VolDelta=0.0BTC, Liqs(1m)=0.\nRecent trades:\nno trades\nRespond ONLY with valid JSON.\n\nCRITICAL: You must respond ONLY with a valid JSON object matching this schema:\n{\n  "properties": {\n    "market_regime": {\n      "enum": [\n        "ranging",\n        "bull_run",\n        "bear_panic",\n        "high_vol_shock"\n      ],\n      "title": "Market Regime",\n      "type": "string"\n    },\n    "grid_bias": {\n      "enum": [\n        "neutral",\n        "bullish",\n        "bearish",\n        "defensive"\n      ],\n      "title": "Grid Bias",\n      "type": "string"\n    },\n    "recommended_grid_top": {\n      "anyOf": [\n        {\n          "type": "number"\n        },\n        {\n          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\\\d*\\\\.?\\\\d*$",\n          "type": "string"\n        }\n      ],\n      "title": "Recommended Grid Top"\n    },\n    "recommended_grid_bottom": {\n      "anyOf": [\n        {\n          "type": "number"\n        },\n        {\n          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\\\d*\\\\.?\\\\d*$",\n          "type": "string"\n        }\n      ],\n      "title": "Recommended Grid Bottom"\n    },\n    "capital_exposure_pct": {\n      "title": "Capital Exposure Pct",\n      "type": "number"\n    },\n    "grid_spacing_multiplier": {\n      "title": "Grid Spacing Multiplier",\n      "type": "number"\n    }\n  },\n  "required": [\n    "market_regime",\n    "grid_bias",\n    "recommended_grid_top",\n    "recommended_grid_bottom",\n    "capital_exposure_pct",\n